   provider \:30ad\:30fc (\:5c0f\:6587\:5b57) \:3092\:8fd4\:3059\:3002\:6587\:5b57\:5217\:4e92\:63db / Automatic /
   \:7a7a\:306f claudecode CLI \:3068\:307f\:306a\:3059\:3002 *)
