      "  Turn 2 (WRONG):   '```mathematica\\n2\\n```'   \[LeftArrow] do NOT echo the result\n\n"];
    
    (* \[HorizontalLine]\[HorizontalLine] \:30c4\:30fc\:30eb\:5b9a\:7fa9\:306e\:6ce8\:5165 \[HorizontalLine]\[HorizontalLine]
       AvailableTools \:304c contextPacket \:306b\:3042\:308c\:3070 prompt \:306b\:6ce8\:5165\:3002
       \:30c4\:30fc\:30eb\:30e2\:30fc\:30c9\:6642\:306f ```mathematica \:306b\:52a0\:3048 <tool_call> \:3082\:4f7f\:3048\:308b\:3002 *)
    Module[{toolDefs = Lookup[contextPacket, "AvailableTools", None]},
      If[ListQ[toolDefs] && Length[toolDefs] > 0,
        AppendTo[parts, iToolDefinitionsToPromptText[toolDefs]];
        AppendTo[parts,
          "You can use ```mathematica code blocks (traditional mode) " <>
          "OR <tool_call> blocks (tool mode). " <>
          "Both are valid. Use tools when you need web search, " <>
